@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……と、言いますと？|#0102Trial11_Warden019| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; BGM変更Sen-Choose N'o SurC
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_38_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_38_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR8,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:だって、鍵の管理は看守がしてたんだよね？|#0102Trial11_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:まあ……そうですね。|#0102Trial11_Warden020| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:だとしたら、それが懲罰房の中にあるって<br>おかしいんじゃないかな。|#0102Trial11_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:仮にそれがナノカちゃんの嘘だとしても、<br>ナノカちゃんが鍵を持っていること自体が<br>その証言と矛盾する……。|#0102Trial11_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; SE・軽い衝撃音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR8,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:看守が鍵を今持っていないことが、<br>ゴクチョーの証言と矛盾しているよ！|#0102Trial11_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; SE・気になる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:ふむ……。<br>たしかにエマさんの言う事も<br>一理あるかもしれませんねぇ……。|#0102Trial11_Warden021| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:しかし看守が勝手に動いたなど……<br>私にも信じがたいことではあるのですが……。|#0102Trial11_Warden022| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right
